# Build output
build/
*.z64
*.pyz
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.dfs
*.sprite

# Vendored dependencies fetched at build time, not redistributed here.
# libdragon is a full git checkout (~67 MB); point LIBDRAGON_ROOT at your own
# and see the README's "Building the ROM". ares is needed only to regenerate
# src/rom_db.c -- `make rom-db ARES=/path/to/ares` -- and never at build time.
third_party/libdragon
third_party/ares

# Box art is the publishers', not ours. The cover pack is built on your
# own machine from artwork you already have; nothing image-shaped belongs
# in this repository.
assets/
covers/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
# ...except the browser's own screenshots for the README.
!docs/screenshots/*.jpg

# Personal card contents: ROM libraries, saves, and firmware state.
# tests/fixtures/registry/ keeps four registry.dat samples on purpose --
# see its README -- but nothing else from a real card.
*.srm
*.eep
*.fla
*.mpk
*.sra
save_db.*
recent.dat
/ED64/

# ...but the golden sprites in tests/fixtures/ are the whole point of the
# make_sprite tests: they were produced by libdragon's own mksprite and are
# compared byte for byte, so they are committed on purpose.
!tests/fixtures/sprites/*.sprite

# Generated card payloads
catalog.ebc
covers.pak
metadata.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Editors and platforms
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
